### src/lib/ifcTileCache.ts
IndexedDB persistence. No external dependencies (native IDB API).

Database: ifctiles_v1  (version 1)
Object stores:
  glb        key: "${hash}::${tileId}"  →  ArrayBuffer  (GLB binary)
  manifests  key: hash                  →  JSON string
  metadata   key: hash                  →  JSON string
  projects   key: hash                  →  JSON string { name, date, tileCount }

Exports:
  hashBuffer(buf)                        → SHA-256 first 16 hex chars (Web Crypto API)
  cacheTileGLB / loadTileGLB
  cacheManifest / loadManifest
  cacheMetadata / loadMetadata
  registerProject / listCachedProjects / deleteProject / projectExists

