### src/lib/ifcTilePipeline.worker.ts
Web Worker — runs off main thread. Imports only web-ifc (WASM).

Pipeline:
  1. IfcAPI.Init() with SetWasmPath('/node_modules/web-ifc/')
  2. OpenModel(uint8Array, { COORDINATE_TO_ORIGIN:true, USE_FAST_BOOLS:true })
  3. Parse IFCBUILDINGSTOREY → FloorInfo[] sorted by elevation
  4. GetLineIDsWithType × 15 element types → expressID→{category,typeName,name} map
  5. StreamAllMeshes:
       per mesh → deinterleave pos+norm → applyMatrix4 (flatTransformation)
       → compute bbox → assignFloor(centroidY) → gridKey(centroidX,centroidZ,20m)
       → accumulate into Map<tileId, TileAccum>
  6. Per tile: postMessage tile_data with Float32Array/Uint32Array transferred (zero-copy)
  7. postMessage complete with RootManifest + ElementMetaMap

Geometry helpers (pure math, no Three.js):
  deinterleave(interleaved)             splits [x,y,z,nx,ny,nz,...] into pos+norm
  applyMatrix4ToPositions(pos, m16)     transforms positions in-place
  applyMatrix4ToNormals(norm, m16)      transforms normals in-place (+ re-normalise)
  computeBBox(positions)                AABB of flat position array
  unionBBox(a, b)                       merge two AABBs

Floor assignment:  highest storey elevation ≤ element centroid Y
Tile ID format:    "F0_G2_1"  (floor_gridCol_gridRow, grid cell = 20m × 20m)

