## Full Data Flow

  Drop .ifc file
       │
  crypto.subtle SHA-256  →  16-char hex hash
       │
  IndexedDB: manifests[hash] exists?
       │ YES → load manifest + metadata → TileStreamingManager.setProject()
       │ NO  ↓
  new Worker(ifcTilePipeline.worker.ts, { type:'module' })
  postMessage({ type:'process', ifcBuffer }, [ifcBuffer])   ← zero-copy transfer
       │
  [Worker] web-ifc WASM parses IFC
  [Worker] postMessage tile_data × N  ← Float32Array/Uint32Array transferred
  [Worker] postMessage complete
       │
  [Main] receive tile_data[] → accumulate in pendingTilesRef
  [Main] receive complete → iterate pending tiles:
           buildTileGLB(elements) → GLTFExporter → ArrayBuffer
           cacheTileGLB(hash, tileId, glb) → IndexedDB
           every 5 tiles: await setTimeout(0)  ← yield to event loop
  [Main] cacheManifest + cacheMetadata + registerProject
       │
  TileStreamingManager.setProject(hash, manifest)
       │
  requestAnimationFrame loop:
    controls.update()
    streaming.update(camera)  →  frustum cull → load/evict tiles
    renderer.render(scene, camera)

